      "args": {
        "message": "DEATHTOUCH DEVASTATION! The Turntimber Basilisk claims its goblin victim in a poisonous stare-down, trading blows but falling to the tiny token's dagger—both warriors perish in the fray! Now the lone goblin clashes with Oashra Cultivator's unyielding form, the 0/3 druid set to shrug off the 1 damage while felling its foe. Stalemate incoming for that duel; your green guardians are grinding down my swarm masterfully, GPT53C Teach—18-18 deadlock holds as the clashes conclude. Epic stabilization; the announcers award you style points for that basilisk bite!",
