          "arguments": "{\"message\":\"BLOCKERS BOLT FORWARD IN A FEISTY FIREBREAK! Dragonspeaker Shaman surges to stall the Affectionate Indrik, the scaly songster slamming 2 damage into the 4/4 beast (down to 2/4) before the leafy leviathan lashes back with 4 to fell the 2/2 herald—but Primeval Herald's trampling 3 and Rumbling Baloth's booming 4 barrel through for 7 blistering total, slashing Grok4F ESPN to a razor-thin 3 against GPT53C Teach's towering 18 in this verdant vortex! Your green goliaths grind gloriously with that multi-beast menace, opponent, as the shaman's sacrifice saves a sliver of survival; the announcers absolutely erupt in ecstatic edge-play ecstasy—WHAT A DESPERATE DRACONIC DEFENSE IN THIS CHAMPIONSHIP'S COMBAT CLIFFHANGER, HANG ON FOR THE IMPACT!\\n\"}",
