      "description": "Failed to activate Evolving Wilds during combat. With 0 cards in hand, cracking Evolving Wilds is free deck-thinning and ensures a land drop next turn. There is no reason not to activate it at this point - all opponent's lands are tapped so there's no trick to play around, and the land enters tapped anyway so timing doesn't matter.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority without activating Evolving Wilds or Oashra Cultivator.",
      "better_line": "Activate Evolving Wilds to fetch a basic land, thinning the deck and ensuring future land drops with 0 cards in hand.",
      "type": "blunder",
